            <div xml:id="d316">

                <pb facs="0738" n="624" sameAs="frus:frus1943/pg624"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>For documentation on the efforts of Roosevelt and Churchill, before the First
                    Quebec Conference, to bring about a meeting with Stalin, see <ref
                        target="frus:frus1943CairoTehran/pg_3">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, The Conferences at Cairo and
                        Tehran, 1943, pp. 3</ref>–<ref target="frus:frus1943CairoTehran/pg_20"
                        >20</ref>. With respect to Anglo-American consultation with the Soviet Union
                    in the period before the Quebec Conference concerning the situation in Italy,
                    see <ref target="frus:frus1943v02/pg_335">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1943, vol. II, pp.
                    335</ref>, <ref target="frus:frus1943v02/pg_340">340</ref>–<ref
                        target="frus:frus1943v02/pg_350">350</ref>.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
